# a root below a file
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/a-file/skills
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: scanning skills directory "<WORLD>/a-file/skills": ondisk: stat skills dir <WORLD>/a-file/skills: stat <WORLD>/a-file/skills: not a directory

# a root with no name
$ skills validate --source-root 
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills validate requires --source-root <skills-dir>

# a relative root
$ skills validate --source-root skills
exit: 0
